              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "болельщик (bolélshchik) — \"a fan, a supporter\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Болельщики пели весь матч. Bolélshchiki péli ves match. The fans sang throughout the match."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine; feminine болельщица. Болеть за + accusative — to support a team."
